    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dht_body",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 76,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "signed: writer verified by signature\ndata: plaintext UNLESS app provides\n  encryption_key (XChaCha20 no-auth)\nseq + writer always visible\n\nread: unrestricted (anyone with key)\nwrite: schema-enforced (signature)\nschema: immutable (hashed into RecordKey)\n\nDHT node CAN read unencrypted data\nDHT node CANNOT forge writes",
      "originalText": "signed: writer verified by signature\ndata: plaintext UNLESS app provides\n  encryption_key (XChaCha20 no-auth)\nseq + writer always visible\n\nread: unrestricted (anyone with key)\nwrite: schema-enforced (signature)\nschema: immutable (hashed into RecordKey)\n\nDHT node CAN read unencrypted data\nDHT node CANNOT forge writes",
